      "id": "a3b8ad88e711",
      "title": "中学施发型令：不合格不让进校门",
      "url": "https://www.baidu.com/s?wd=%E4%B8%AD%E5%AD%A6%E6%96%BD%E5%8F%91%E5%9E%8B%E4%BB%A4%EF%BC%9A%E4%B8%8D%E5%90%88%E6%A0%BC%E4%B8%8D%E8%AE%A9%E8%BF%9B%E6%A0%A1%E9%97%A8",
      "source": "baidu",
      "category": "general",
